@startuml seq-fr6-denied
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
actor Alice as A
participant "auth-gateway" as G
participant "report-service" as R
participant "car-service" as C

A -> G : POST /cars/2/reports\nuser token (Bob owns car 2)
G -> G : verify user token,\nrole seller allowed
G -> C : GET /cars/2\nservice token (sub=alice, scope=cars:read)
C -> C : owner(car 2) == bob ≠ alice
C --> G : 404
G --> A : 404
note over G, R
  No job token is issued and
  the report service is never contacted.
end note
note over C
  Second layer: even if the gateway check
  were missing, the car service would reject
  a job token whose sub does not own the car
  (removing both checks gave V4).
end note
@enduml